+# TEE Attestation Setup Guide
+
+## Architecture
+
+```
+Build completes → post-build-hook (nix-certifier) → certificate JSON
+Next build starts → libstore checks direct inputs → certificate required
+Bootstrap inputs → pinned NAR hashes in nix.conf (no certificate)
+```
+
+## File map
+
+| File | Role |
+|------|------|
+| `src/libstore/attestation.cc` | Pre-build verification in Nix |
+| `src/libstore/include/nix/store/attestation-settings.hh` | nix.conf options |
+| `src/libstore/build/derivation-building-goal.cc` | Calls verify before build |
+| `contrib/attestation/nix-certifier` | Post-build certificate creator |
+| `contrib/attestation/nix-attestation-verify` | External quote verifier |
+| `contrib/attestation/binding.py` | Shared binding digest v1 |
+
+## nix.conf
+
+```ini
+require-attestation = true
+substitute = false
+attestation-store = /var/lib/nix-attestations
+attestation-verifier = /usr/local/bin/nix-attestation-verify
+post-build-hook = /usr/local/bin/nix-certifier
+attestation-bootstrap-inputs = sha256-... sha256-...
+```
+
+Dev without TDX hardware:
+
+```bash
+export ATTESTATION_STUB_MODE=1
+```
+
+## Docker package-builder layout
+
+```
+contrib/attestation/package-builder/
+├── Dockerfile              # stages: nix-tee-prep, nix-tee-base, package-builder
+├── build.sh
+├── nokia-runner/Dockerfile # FROM nix-tee-base; overlays + packages/*.nix
+├── nix-docker.conf
+├── jo.nix, overlays, vendor/, packages/
+└── stage-nokia-runner.sh
+```
+
+Fork source is `--build-context nixsrc=…` (see `build.sh`), not a `nix-src/` copy in this folder.
+
+## Build order
+
+1. `NIX_SRC=/path/to/fork ./build.sh nix-tee-base nix-tee-base`
+2. `NIX_SRC=/path/to/fork ./build.sh package-builder nix-jo-builder`
+3. Optional: `./stage-nokia-runner.sh` then Nokia `test_docker.py` (second image)
+
+## Bootstrap
+
+```bash
+nix-store --add-fixed sha256 bootstrap-tools.tar.xz
+chmod +x busybox && nix-store --add-fixed --recursive sha256 busybox
+nix path-info --json <path> | jq '.[0].narHash'
+```
+
+Add hashes to `attestation-bootstrap-inputs`.
