+# Demo script (10 slides)
+
+`slides.html` — `N` hides blue/gold boxes.
+
+**1** Built overlay jo, signed sidecars, Harmonia serves, fork verifies then copies. Live: curl, nix copy, jo.  
+*Bolo:* jo, sign, cache, client verify. Live copy.
+
+**2** Builder 24.04, Harmonia :5000, client fork. Two keys: cache.local-1 narinfo, harmonia-1 cert. Both on client.
+
+**3** `./build.sh nix-tee-base` then nokia-runner + test_docker.py, then sign/push. Not rebuilding. Not the failed package-builder target.
+
+**4** Path `i0d0rjpig00qhhmf1qnvndavn82cfv22-jo-1.7`. Same hashPart for narinfo/json/sig. No flake/nix-shell.
+
+**5** curl cache-info, narinfo (Sig cache.local-1), json+sig 200.
+
+**6** Stop daemon+socket. Fork nix copy, both keys, stub mode.
+
+**7** Log: fetched json/sig → verified → copying path. Wrong order = stop.
+
+**8** `jo -a 1 2 3` → `[1,2,3]`
+
+**9** Optional: hide .sig, copy fails, restore.
+
+**10** Client refuses NAR without builder signature. Stub quotes / not stock daemon — one line only.
